# Getting into a cryo chamber with the hands and out of it again with Y held.
# The cryo chamber is its own kind of seat (the game's cryo pod), so the controls label names it.
plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet

# ---- Setup: the station's cryo chamber (a cryo chamber is used only with power, which one built on its own grid has none of) --
admin creativeTools
# Earth Planet's station belongs to the world's own identity: the game lets the player use it once they own it
own EarthEasyStation
# Stand before it, facing it. The pod's door is low and ahead, so the hand reaches down-forward.
goto Cryo Chamber 1.0
wait 2
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60
head 0 1.6 0
hand left -0.25 1.2 -0.3
hand right 0 1.3 -0.6
wait 1

# ---- Before: on foot, not in any seat ------------------------------------------------------------------------
read character
expect state != sitting
expect controlledEntity == null

# ---- Reach the seat with the right hand and grip: the game's Use, so the character sits ------------------------
# (Hand coordinates are a first guess; the log line "Grab use: Right palm ... box middle at tracking x,y,z" says where
# the seat's use spot is, head-relative, to tune them.)
press right grip
wait 1.5
release right grip
wait 1

# ---- After: seated in the block, and the hands' controls are the ship's ------------------------------------------
read character
expect state == sitting
expect controlledEntity.type == MyCryoChamber
expect log VR controls: ship controller (CryoChamber) within 5

# ---- Leave: hold Y (left B) for half a second, the game's Use held, which leaves the seat -----------------------
press left b
wait 0.8
release left b
wait 1.5
read character
expect state != sitting
expect controlledEntity == null
expect log VR controls: on foot within 5
